#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:154
msgid ""
"Pixel values were asserted identical to a local read of the same window. "
"Real savings depend on AOI size, tile layout and the provider's COG block "
"structure. Small AOIs in large tiles gain the most."
msgstr ""
"已断言像素值与对同一窗口的本地读取结果一致。实际节省量取决于 AOI 大小、瓦片布局和提供商的 COG 块结构。大瓦片中的小 AOI 收益最大。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:158
msgid "Behaviour to be aware of"
msgstr "需要注意的行为"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:160
msgid ""
"**Rectangular window.** The window is your AOI's bounding box rounded "
"outward to whole pixels. It is not masked to a polygon."
msgstr "**矩形窗口。** 该窗口是你的 AOI 边界框向外取整到整像素后的范围。它不会按多边形进行掩膜。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:161
msgid "**Rotated or sheared rasters** raise `NotImplementedError`."
msgstr "**旋转或剪切的栅格**会引发 `NotImplementedError`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:162
msgid ""
"**JP2 assets** are accepted but untested. Windowed JPEG 2000 reads are "
"slower and less predictable than COG."
msgstr "**JP2 资产**可被接受，但未经测试。窗口化的 JPEG 2000 读取比 COG 更慢，也更难预测。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:163
msgid ""
"**Collections for Planetary Computer.** "
"`SearchQuery(collections=[\"SENTINEL-2\"])` matches nothing because the "
"provider passes collection names through verbatim. Use "
"`satellites=[\"sentinel-2\"]`, which maps to `sentinel-2-l2a`."
msgstr ""
"**Planetary Computer 的集合。** `SearchQuery(collections=[\"SENTINEL-2\"])` "
"不会匹配任何内容，因为该提供商会原样传递集合名称。请使用 `satellites=[\"sentinel-2\"]`，它会映射到 "
"`sentinel-2-l2a`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:164
msgid ""
"**Strict band matching.** The regular `download()` falls back to *all* "
"assets when a band name matches nothing. Streaming treats an unmatched band "
"as an error, because the fallback would be expensive."
msgstr ""
"**严格的波段匹配。** 当波段名称不匹配任何资产时，常规的 `download()` "
"会回退到*所有*资产。流式读取则把未匹配的波段视为错误，因为这种回退代价高昂。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:165
msgid ""
"**Sentinel-2 L2A offset.** Scenes processed with baseline 04.00 or later "
"store `DN = reflectance x 10000 + 1000`. Indices such as NDVI are not "
"offset-invariant, so subtract the offset before computing them. The [multi-"
"sensor pipelines](../processing/multisensor.md) accept `optical_offset` and "
"`optical_scale` for this."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-2 L2A 偏移。** 采用基线 04.00 或更高版本处理的场景存储的是 `DN = reflectance x 10000 +"
" 1000`。NDVI "
"等指数并非偏移不变，因此在计算之前请先减去偏移。[多传感器流程](../processing/multisensor.md)为此接受 "
"`optical_offset` 和 `optical_scale`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:167
msgid "Other streaming tools"
msgstr "其他流式读取工具"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:169
msgid ""
"`pygeofetch.stac_compute` and the `pygeofetch stream` commands predate this "
"module and work on a **single URL** rather than on search results:"
msgstr ""
"`pygeofetch.stac_compute` 和 `pygeofetch stream` 命令早于此模块，针对的是**单个 "
"URL**，而不是搜索结果："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:172
msgid ""
"`pygeofetch stream cog-window URL --bbox ... --output out.tif` reads one "
"window from one COG."
msgstr ""
"`pygeofetch stream cog-window URL --bbox ... --output out.tif` 从一个 COG "
"读取一个窗口。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:173
msgid ""
"`pygeofetch stream to-zarr`, `to-geoparquet` and `zarr-to-tif` convert local"
" data to cloud-native formats."
msgstr ""
"`pygeofetch stream to-zarr`、`to-geoparquet` 和 `zarr-to-tif` 将本地数据转换为云原生格式。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:174
msgid ""
"`pygeofetch.stac_compute.burst_streaming` reads Sentinel-1 SLC bursts "
"remotely for InSAR."
msgstr ""
"`pygeofetch.stac_compute.burst_streaming` 为 InSAR 远程读取 Sentinel-1 SLC burst。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/streaming.md:176
msgid ""
"Use `client.stream()` for scenes from a search, with provider "
"authentication, coverage reporting and resume. Use the `stream` commands for"
" a URL you already have."
msgstr ""
"对于来自搜索的场景，需要提供商认证、覆盖率报告和断点续传时，请使用 `client.stream()`。对于你已有的 URL，请使用 `stream` "
"命令。"
